# Archive policy

- Active scripts only: `scripts/README.md` (~30 files).
- Deleted script inventory: `scripts/archive/MANIFEST.md` (recover via `git show`).
- Do not grep `scripts/archive/` for `.py` files — removed 2026-09-01.
- `outputs/` is local cruft; keep list in `docs/OUTPUTS_RETENTION.md`. Do not enumerate unless asked.
- `src/archive/` only for explicit `legacy_species` / biochem repro.
